(7700274, 1264013, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous backdrop.  Lovely photo.</td>', 'What a gorgeous backdrop.  Lovely photo.', '2021-09-03 06:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700275, 1263999, 67258, '<td valign="top">Perfect photo for the challenge. Totally reminiscent of upland Britain - could be high in the Yorkshire Dales, but I see from your title this is likely to be Scotland.</td>', 'Perfect photo for the challenge. Totally reminiscent of upland Britain - could be high in the Yorkshire Dales, but I see from your title this is likely to be Scotland.', '2021-09-03 06:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700277, 1264027, 67258, '<td valign="top">Definitely an interesting take, and a good use of the extended editing rule set.</td>', 'Definitely an interesting take, and a good use of the extended editing rule set.', '2021-09-03 06:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700279, 1263995, 67258, '<td valign="top">Woah, that is unexpected.  Must be even more bizarre to see in real life.  Excellent entry.<br/> <br/>Edit - just realised that this is extended 3ditting, so possibly a composite.  My high score stands, as composite or not, it made me gasp.</td>', 'Woah, that is unexpected.  Must be even more bizarre to see in real life.  Excellent entry. Edit - just realised that this is extended 3ditting, so possibly a composite.  My high score stands, as composite or not, it made me gasp.', '2021-09-03 06:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700280, 1264017, 67258, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of the extended editing rule set.  Pleasingly done, and a positive message.</td>', 'Excellent use of the extended editing rule set.  Pleasingly done, and a positive message.', '2021-09-03 06:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700303, 1263995, 273222, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition!</td>', 'Lovely composition!', '2021-09-03 13:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700351, 1263995, 124815, '<td valign="top">What a nice find and composition. And fine processing also</td>', 'What a nice find and composition. And fine processing also', '2021-09-03 18:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700352, 1263806, 124815, '<td valign="top">funny place to be</td>', 'funny place to be', '2021-09-03 18:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700353, 1264027, 124815, '<td valign="top">Well Mark, I don''t think this is your finest. I marked it 5 for the effort though.</td>', 'Well Mark, I don''t think this is your finest. I marked it 5 for the effort though.', '2021-09-03 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700354, 1263677, 124815, '<td valign="top">The sharpening and saturation got so prominent here. I make a comment because few comments are made nowadays and, who knows, it might help. <br/>But honestly, either than being "a single tree" I do not understand the idea behind this shot. <br/>Hope that you take the comment in the constructive spirit in which it was made</td>', 'The sharpening and saturation got so prominent here. I make a comment because few comments are made nowadays and, who knows, it might help. But honestly, either than being "a single tree" I do not understand the idea behind this shot. Hope that you take the comment in the constructive spirit in which it was made', '2021-09-03 18:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700375, 1263677, 67145, '<td valign="top">nice pic .. i just imagined you taking pics of this tree as it grows .. in different seasons .. etc .. could make a great ''thing'' .. cant think of the word .. :)</td>', 'nice pic .. i just imagined you taking pics of this tree as it grows .. in different seasons .. etc .. could make a great ''thing'' .. cant think of the word .. :)', '2021-09-04 02:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
