(7700377, 1264027, 67145, '<td valign="top">great idea .. really speaks to me .. as personal growth is my thing atm .. and has been for some time .. this should do great in the challenge .. <br/>what really appeals is that the tree growing out of your head .. like your head is very fertile ground .. good one . :)</td>', 'great idea .. really speaks to me .. as personal growth is my thing atm .. and has been for some time .. this should do great in the challenge .. what really appeals is that the tree growing out of your head .. like your head is very fertile ground .. good one . :)', '2021-09-04 02:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700378, 1264026, 67145, '<td valign="top">not sure why but this speaks of australia to me .. could be the trunk that looks a lot like the trees around where i live .. one trunk could be a squiggly gum .. dont quote me on that .. !! .. ;)<br/>great take on the challenge btw . :)</td>', 'not sure why but this speaks of australia to me .. could be the trunk that looks a lot like the trees around where i live .. one trunk could be a squiggly gum .. dont quote me on that .. !! .. ;)great take on the challenge btw . :)', '2021-09-04 02:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
