(7700381, 1263650, 67145, '<td valign="top">i reckon i could give this tree a run for its money .. re the bad hair day .. <br/>loving all the details in the bark and the black and white edit .. really works for this shot . :)</td>', 'i reckon i could give this tree a run for its money .. re the bad hair day .. loving all the details in the bark and the black and white edit .. really works for this shot . :)', '2021-09-04 02:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700382, 1264013, 67145, '<td valign="top">OMG .. first reaction .. have you gone to my local lookout .. burragorang lookout .. this looks so much like it . <br/>not many dpcers around where i live .. <br/>after a moment or so .. trouble is theres no water down in your valley .. <br/>perfect entry for the challenge .. even with so many other trees that last one standing is the subject .. :)<br/>FYI .. <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Burragorang+lookout+and+picnic+area/@-34.0430793,150.4455439,13z/data=!4m10!1m2!3m1!2sBurragorang+Lookout!3m6!1s0x6b1251a458212e69:0xe7328e069c80f1c3!8m2!3d-34.0689178!4d150.4339643!9m1!1b1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">burragorang lookout - google maps</a></td>', 'OMG .. first reaction .. have you gone to my local lookout .. burragorang lookout .. this looks so much like it . not many dpcers around where i live .. after a moment or so .. trouble is theres no water down in your valley .. perfect entry for the challenge .. even with so many other trees that last one standing is the subject .. :)FYI .. burragorang lookout - google maps', '2021-09-04 03:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700383, 1264011, 67145, '<td valign="top">perfect .. !! .. <br/>wonderful entry for the challenge .. and i love that its not just a photo but a message .. hoping for a ribbon .. :)</td>', 'perfect .. !! .. wonderful entry for the challenge .. and i love that its not just a photo but a message .. hoping for a ribbon .. :)', '2021-09-04 03:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700385, 1264017, 67145, '<td valign="top">when this opened i thought it might be a Larry hand . <br/>i could be totally wrong of course .. not having seen his hands IRL or even taken much notice here in dpc .. <br/>so now i''ve gone on and on about Larry''s hands .. i might take this opportunity to make a comment on this AWESOME image ..<br/>its the second pic i''ve come on in this challenge that''s a fantastic image all by itself .. but also has a message . <br/>love what you have created here .. its excellent .. :)<br/> <br/>a few seconds later .. <br/>i had given you a 9 .. then noticed that the other pic i was talking about got a 10 ... so because they are both wonderful i''m bumping you up .. :)</td>', 'when this opened i thought it might be a Larry hand . i could be totally wrong of course .. not having seen his hands IRL or even taken much notice here in dpc .. so now i''ve gone on and on about Larry''s hands .. i might take this opportunity to make a comment on this AWESOME image ..its the second pic i''ve come on in this challenge that''s a fantastic image all by itself .. but also has a message . love what you have created here .. its excellent .. :) a few seconds later .. i had given you a 9 .. then noticed that the other pic i was talking about got a 10 ... so because they are both wonderful i''m bumping you up .. :)', '2021-09-04 03:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700388, 1264020, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing.</td>', 'I really like the processing.', '2021-09-04 07:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700389, 1264000, 4008, '<td valign="top">Not much attention is drawn to the tree, more to the car, shop and people. But maybe that is what you want to express: the tree seems to be out of place but is still there and alive.</td>', 'Not much attention is drawn to the tree, more to the car, shop and people. But maybe that is what you want to express: the tree seems to be out of place but is still there and alive.', '2021-09-04 07:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700390, 1263677, 4008, '<td valign="top">Rather a straight-on shot, nothing special.</td>', 'Rather a straight-on shot, nothing special.', '2021-09-04 07:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700391, 1264028, 4008, '<td valign="top">Is it a tree?</td>', 'Is it a tree?', '2021-09-04 07:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700392, 1264027, 4008, '<td valign="top">It is well executed but these kind of images just don''t appeal to me. I don''t like the  two-color tone either. (still an 8 from me because of the different approach)</td>', 'It is well executed but these kind of images just don''t appeal to me. I don''t like the  two-color tone either. (still an 8 from me because of the different approach)', '2021-09-04 07:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700393, 1264010, 4008, '<td valign="top">Somehow I like it. Mysterious.</td>', 'Somehow I like it. Mysterious.', '2021-09-04 07:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700394, 1263883, 4008, '<td valign="top">Could do with some more emptry space.</td>', 'Could do with some more emptry space.', '2021-09-04 07:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700395, 1264008, 4008, '<td valign="top">Rathe straight on shot. Nothing special to me.</td>', 'Rathe straight on shot. Nothing special to me.', '2021-09-04 07:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700397, 1264026, 4008, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a tree with strong shapes in a nice light. Not sure why it needs multiple shots and frames.</td>', 'Seems to be a tree with strong shapes in a nice light. Not sure why it needs multiple shots and frames.', '2021-09-04 07:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700433, 1264027, 100831, '<td valign="top">The hand is what makes this work hold together somehow for me. And it took me a bit, but I''m leaning towards personal best.</td>', 'The hand is what makes this work hold together somehow for me. And it took me a bit, but I''m leaning towards personal best.', '2021-09-04 13:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700434, 1264017, 100831, '<td valign="top">I love your message. Funny, 10-15 years ago hands-off the natural wilderness was said to be the way to go, but now things are changing so rapidly that who knows what we can do.</td>', 'I love your message. Funny, 10-15 years ago hands-off the natural wilderness was said to be the way to go, but now things are changing so rapidly that who knows what we can do.', '2021-09-04 13:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700435, 1263981, 100831, '<td valign="top">whoa! Great picture... perfect monochrome.</td>', 'whoa! Great picture... perfect monochrome.', '2021-09-04 13:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700436, 1263995, 100831, '<td valign="top">ups and downs. Love this.</td>', 'ups and downs. Love this.', '2021-09-04 13:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700467, 1263995, 101668, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful entry. My eye spy another tree but the palm is rather single isn''t it?</td>', 'Such a beautiful entry. My eye spy another tree but the palm is rather single isn''t it?', '2021-09-05 07:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
