(7700469, 1264025, 101668, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, outstanding as the tree but the singleness of the tree?</td>', 'This is beautiful, outstanding as the tree but the singleness of the tree?', '2021-09-05 07:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700628, 1264025, 65234, '<td valign="top">It has its own spotlight! I might have cropped off more on the left.</td>', 'It has its own spotlight! I might have cropped off more on the left.', '2021-09-07 12:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700629, 1263883, 65234, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing that tree doesn''t fall over. Fun composition here.</td>', 'It''s amazing that tree doesn''t fall over. Fun composition here.', '2021-09-07 12:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700704, 1264026, 38162, '<td valign="top">The one on left should have been it and would have scored very high from me. Lower right not well lit. Overall Im afraid this just screams I cant decide.  The cliche less is more is floating about as well. Damn, this is hard decision. Curious how others will react. GL.</td>', 'The one on left should have been it and would have scored very high from me. Lower right not well lit. Overall Im afraid this just screams I cant decide.  The cliche less is more is floating about as well. Damn, this is hard decision. Curious how others will react. GL.', '2021-09-08 12:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700798, 1264011, 3306, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. Blue ribbon for sure. The lighting, the set up, the creativity are wonderful.</td>', 'Outstanding. Blue ribbon for sure. The lighting, the set up, the creativity are wonderful.', '2021-09-09 08:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700799, 1264027, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wow. This is awesome. So original and creative. Ribbon for sure as far as Im concerned. The only problem is when you need a haircut!</td>', 'Wow. This is awesome. So original and creative. Ribbon for sure as far as Im concerned. The only problem is when you need a haircut!', '2021-09-09 08:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700800, 1263995, 3306, '<td valign="top">Outstanding find and great shot. I really like it in B&amp;W. One of my favorites.</td>', 'Outstanding find and great shot. I really like it in B&W. One of my favorites.', '2021-09-09 08:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700802, 1264026, 3306, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the effort you have put into this composition. It is the only one like it in this challenge and deserves the front page.</td>', 'I appreciate the effort you have put into this composition. It is the only one like it in this challenge and deserves the front page.', '2021-09-09 08:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700803, 1264002, 3306, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. A beautifully composed scene. The sunset lighting makes the scene.</td>', 'One of my favorites. A beautifully composed scene. The sunset lighting makes the scene.', '2021-09-09 08:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700804, 1263650, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused on the texture of the bark and interesting perspective.</td>', 'Nicely focused on the texture of the bark and interesting perspective.', '2021-09-09 08:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700805, 1264025, 3306, '<td valign="top">A very creative idea in isolating a single tree for this challenge. Your composition and the tree really sticks out!</td>', 'A very creative idea in isolating a single tree for this challenge. Your composition and the tree really sticks out!', '2021-09-09 08:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700806, 1263806, 3306, '<td valign="top">The people in the scene add purpose to your composition. Nicely done.</td>', 'The people in the scene add purpose to your composition. Nicely done.', '2021-09-09 08:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700807, 1264013, 3306, '<td valign="top">I have photographed this tree myself! Brings back great memories of a trip with my son. Great sky and of course the Grand Canyon in the background.</td>', 'I have photographed this tree myself! Brings back great memories of a trip with my son. Great sky and of course the Grand Canyon in the background.', '2021-09-09 08:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700809, 1263994, 3306, '<td valign="top">That sky is amazing. I had taken a similar idea but chose otherwise because I knew the voters would feel it was a picture of multiple trees. I have voted your entry on the quality, idea, and composition and not the specific interpretation of the challenge. Its a very good entry! I like your title:)</td>', 'That sky is amazing. I had taken a similar idea but chose otherwise because I knew the voters would feel it was a picture of multiple trees. I have voted your entry on the quality, idea, and composition and not the specific interpretation of the challenge. Its a very good entry! I like your title:)', '2021-09-09 09:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700810, 1263883, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like the scene as you have composed it as a panorama. The tree is amazing and I like the idea you have presented. I cant help but think this was taken with a cellphone as it is slightly out of focus and maybe a little too strong on the saturation. Should do well though on the overall.</td>', 'I really like the scene as you have composed it as a panorama. The tree is amazing and I like the idea you have presented. I cant help but think this was taken with a cellphone as it is slightly out of focus and maybe a little too strong on the saturation. Should do well though on the overall.', '2021-09-09 09:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700812, 1264020, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I like everything you have done with this shot to show your photographic talents in composition and technicality.</td>', 'Very well done. I like everything you have done with this shot to show your photographic talents in composition and technicality.', '2021-09-09 09:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700813, 1263999, 3306, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to photograph this scene. There is so much to see and many potential viewpoints. I  get the opportunity to go out and shoot with my son on occasion. We often times will be taking a picture of the same scene but he sees it differently than I do. I love to see his interpretation. I like the way you have used your title to explain your purpose.</td>', 'I would have loved to photograph this scene. There is so much to see and many potential viewpoints. I  get the opportunity to go out and shoot with my son on occasion. We often times will be taking a picture of the same scene but he sees it differently than I do. I love to see his interpretation. I like the way you have used your title to explain your purpose.', '2021-09-09 09:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700814, 1263717, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like that your perspective is in focus from bottom to top. Nicely done.</td>', 'I like that your perspective is in focus from bottom to top. Nicely done.', '2021-09-09 09:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700815, 1264029, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done at a slight angle to show the important elements of the tree. It makes it interesting. The use of B&amp;W also helps to express your intentions.</td>', 'Well done at a slight angle to show the important elements of the tree. It makes it interesting. The use of B&W also helps to express your intentions.', '2021-09-09 09:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7700816, 1263982, 3306, '<td valign="top">I understand your intention here and your title does well to express it. It gives the composition purpose.</td>', 'I understand your intention here and your title does well to express it. It gives the composition purpose.', '2021-09-09 09:22:02.000000', NULL, 1),
