/a></td>', 'Originally posted by ThingFish: Congratz...very nice image...reminds me a lot of these entries on DPC from a few years back. But yours is the nicest by far.https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=393912 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=773546 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=718812 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1128465 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=520971 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=394322   Thanks, Fred, for the kudos! Wow!  You went to a bunch of work researching those!     I agree that they are similar to each other... and probably none is the original idea.  I even did it myself a few years ago: ', '2021-09-10 11:36:23.000000', NULL, 0),
