(7700909, 1264011, 99263, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ThingFish:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratz...very nice image...reminds me a lot of these entries on DPC from a few years back. But yours is the nicest by far.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=393912" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=393912</a> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=773546" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=773546</a> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=718812" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=718812</a> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1128465" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1128465</a> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=520971" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=520971</a> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=394322" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=394322</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks, Fred, for the kudos!<br/> <br/>Wow!  You went to a bunch of work researching those!     I agree that they are similar to each other... and probably none is the original idea.  I even did it myself a few years ago:<br/> <br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1206519" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2542/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1206519.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2542/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1206519.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/2000-2999/2542/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1206519.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Wasn''t a bunch of work really...you just have to enter the correct words in the search function :)  I just happened to have seen many images similar to your beautiful photo in the past. I also like the entry from 2017 that you just posted a link of...very beautiful. I don''t know who created the very first/original photo of this concept but there''s a lot of images in this vein on the internet. Have a look at the following link: <a href="https://www.google.com/search?q=tree+in+soil+in+hands&amp;source=lnms&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiiy-3h3PTyAhVGT8AKHdAjCkAQ_AUoAXoECAEQAw&amp;biw=1844&amp;bih=1019" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">https://www.google.com/search?q=tree+in+soil+in+hands&amp;source=lnms&amp;tbm=isch&amp;sa=X&amp;ved=2ahUKEwiiy-3h3PTyAhVGT8AKHdAjCkAQ_AUoAXoECAEQAw&amp;biw=1844&amp;bih=1019</a></td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: Originally posted by ThingFish: Congratz...very nice image...reminds me a lot of these entries on DPC from a few years back. But yours is the nicest by far.https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=393912 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=773546 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=718812 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1128465 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=520971 https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=394322   Thanks, Fred, for the kudos! Wow!  You went to a bunch of work researching those!     I agree that they are similar to each other... and probably none is the original idea.  I even did it myself a few years ago:    Wasn''t a bunch of work really...you just have to enter the correct words in the search function :)  I just happened to have seen many images similar to your beautiful photo in the past. I also like the entry from 2017 that you just posted a link of...very beautiful. I don''t know who created the very first/original photo of this concept but there''s a lot of images in this vein on the internet. Have a look at the following link: https://www.google.com/search?q=tree+in+soil+in+hands&source=lnms&tbm=isch&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiiy-3h3PTyAhVGT8AKHdAjCkAQ_AUoAXoECAEQAw&biw=1844&bih=1019', '2021-09-10 12:35:37.000000', NULL, 0),
